OL,3,GNEWSASevere delays on M25 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing severe delays on
OL,7,Fthe M25 in Surrey after a multi-vehicle
OL,8,Fcrash forced the closure of three out
OL,9,Fof four lanes on the clockwise
OL,10,Fcarriageway, according to traffic
OL,11,Fmonitoring service Inrix.
OL,13,FThe collision, involving three vans and
OL,14,Fa lorry, happened at about 06:55 GMT on
OL,15,FWednesday between junction 11 for
OL,16,FChertsey and junction 12 for Thorpe.
OL,17,FOne person was injured and taken to
OL,18,Fhospital, Surrey Police said.
OL,20,FNational Highways said just after 09:40
OL,21,Fall lanes had reopened but there were
OL,22,Fstill delays of about 60 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
